        "intuition": "Shift paradigm to a pairwise preference loss emphasizing the logarithm of the absolute margin combined with advantage gap, linked by a sigmoid to produce smooth gradients. We weight pairs by the advantage gap and aggregate losses by summed weighted loss, encouraging stronger emphasis on pairs with higher advantage gap and more nuanced margin sensitivity via the log transformation.",
